@startuml SAYCEP_A3_Activity_Plan
' Assignment 3 Q3.5, part B - the My plan dashboard and its progress loop
' (UC-12, UC-13, FR-11), as implemented in frontend/app.js. Version 1.1.
title End-to-End Journey, part B: My plan dashboard (as implemented)
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FEFEFE

start
:Arrive from Save as my plan, or a return visit
with a saved plan id in this browser;
if (Profile still exists, with a target?) then (no)
  #FBEAEA:Forget the stored id,
  start the journey afresh (Figure 5a);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
repeat
  :Show goal, readiness (must-haves held),
  route with ready steps ticked, next step;
  :Choose an action on a skill;
  if (Action?) then (start learning)
    :Record status = learning
    (gap unchanged);
  elseif (I can do this now) then
    :Record status = held;
    #D6E8F5:Recompute gap, pathway and readiness;
  else (undo)
    :Remove the skill;
    :Recompute gap, pathway and readiness;
  endif
repeat while (Goal reached or user leaves?) is (no)
-> yes;
:Completion - every must-have held,
or plan kept for the next visit;
stop
@enduml
